<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,0); COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-highlight: rgb(255,255,0)"><FONT face=宋体></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415560295.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415560295.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415561567.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415561567.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415563023.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415563023.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>他首先祝贺各位新生能以优异的成绩顺利考入绍兴一中，希望新生们</FONT>“为人真”“为学真”，鼓励大家要敢于拥有伟大的梦想，并且为之脚踏实地、风雨兼程。未来的高中三年，同学们定会不辱一中人“求真知，觅真理，做真人”的光荣使命，成就最美最好的自己，续写一中的荣光与历史。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>新生代表高格格发言。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,0); COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-highlight: rgb(255,255,0)"><FONT face=宋体></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415564571.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415564571.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>她回顾了过去几年的求学奋斗，为能实现一中梦、成为一中人而感到骄傲与自豪。她相信在底蕴深厚的一中校园里一定会遇见很多良师益友；她提醒同学们一定要坚持理想、脚踏实地，为遇见更美好的自己而努力奋斗。她承诺，作为一中的新鲜血液，高一新生定会用奋斗填充青春的底色，抵达成功的彼岸，绽放最美的青春。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>党委副书记孙洪亮老师以</FONT>“心中有梦，脚下有路，眼里有光”为题，执教“开学第一课”。</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; BACKGROUND: rgb(255,255,0); COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-highlight: rgb(255,255,0)"><FONT face=宋体></FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415565842.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415565842.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>着眼于</FONT>“我想要什么（目标）”和“我能怎么做（行动）”两个角度，孙老师的课堂深入浅出，气氛活跃。从马斯克、马云到一中学长学姐，孙老师用鲜活的例子启发同学们深入领会“多关注目标，少纠结条件”“心有多大，舞台就有多大”“两点之间，直线最短”等人生哲理。最后他带领同学们一起宣誓：在一中成就最好的自己！</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>党政办王晶晶老师和全体同学分享了一堂校史讲座，她为新生们娓娓道来，让大家更好地走进一中，了解一中，迷上一中。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415572182.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415572182.jpg" width=1280 height=960> </A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">13</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">:</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">00</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，住管处林萍华老师为新生们作住校生活指导，希望学生们可以尽早适应环境，独立生活，提升自我。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415573808.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415573808.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415575319.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415575319.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">14</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">:</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">00</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，语文学科主讲人陈雪萍老师和外语学科主讲人楼立青老师就高中语文和英语学习进行了详细的学法指导，引导新生们提早做好准备并布置好暑期任务。</FONT></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415582379.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415582379.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415584043.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415584043.jpg" width=1200 height=801> </A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><A href="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415585701.jpg" target=_blank><IMG onload=resizepic(this) onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/202007/2020071415585701.jpg" width=1280 height=592> </A></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">1</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">6</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt">:</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体">50</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>，繁忙而充实的一天暂时告一段落。</FONT></SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0pt; TEXT-INDENT: 21pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0000"><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-bidi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt"><FONT face=宋体>一中舞台的帷幕已经为你拉开，你</FONT>——准备好了吗？</SPAN><SPAN style="FONT-SIZE: 10.5pt; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman'; COLOR: rgb(0,0,0); mso-spacerun: 'yes'; mso-font-kerning: 1.0000pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 宋体"><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
